<title>ISRAEL: TENNIS-SANCHEZ BEATS ONDRUSKA IN ISRAELI OPEN FINAL.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-SANCHEZ BEATS ONDRUSKA IN ISRAELI OPEN FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>TEL AVIV 1996-10-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the final in the</p>
<p>$328,000 Israel Open tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number</p>
<p>denotes seeding):</p>
<p>4-Javier Sanchez (Spain) beat Marcos Ondruska (South Africa)</p>
<p>6-4 7-5</p>
</text>
